OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will turn
OL,6,Fincreasingly cloudy as outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain spread east through the evening
OL,8,Fand overnight, rain becoming heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes. Mainly dry by morning with just
OL,10,Fa few showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FBright spells and some
OL,13,Fshowers through the day, some turning
OL,14,Fheavy and thundery in the afternoon
OL,15,Fand early evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
